During Game play "Hold L2+R2" And press the Button Sequence
for the Said Cheats
Press the same Sequence again to turn code off
Cheat Sprite A
triangle, cross, circle, square, cross, triangle, square, circle
Cheat Sprite B
cross, cross, triangle, square, square, circle, triangle, cross
Cheat Sprite C
circle, triangle, square, cross, circle, triangle, square, cross

